#: ../../library/stm.rst:4
msgid ":mod:`stm` --- functionality specific to STM32 MCUs"
msgstr ":mod:`stm` --- funkcionalnost specifična za STM32 MCU-ove"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:9
msgid ""
"This module provides functionality specific to STM32 microcontrollers, "
"including direct access to peripheral registers."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul omogućuje funkcionalnost specifičnu za STM32 mikrokontrolere, "
"uključujući izravan pristup registrima periferije."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:13
msgid "Memory access"
msgstr "Pristup memoriji"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:15
msgid ""
"The module exposes three subscriptable objects used for raw memory access. "
"Each behaves like a sparse array indexed by byte address: ``value = "
"memN[addr]`` reads, ``memN[addr] = value`` writes. The address is always a "
"byte address, regardless of the access width."
msgstr ""
"Modul izlaže tri indeksirana objekta koja se koriste za izravan pristup "
"memoriji. Svaki se ponaša poput rijetkog polja indeksiranog adresom bajta: "
"``value = memN[addr]`` čita, ``memN[addr] = value`` piše. Adresa je uvijek "
"adresa bajta, neovisno o širini pristupa."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:20
msgid ""
"These memory objects can be used in combination with the peripheral register"
" constants below to read and write MCU hardware peripheral registers, as "
"well as any other location in the SoC's address space."
msgstr ""
"Ovi memorijski objekti mogu se koristiti u kombinaciji s konstantama "
"registara periferije navedenima u nastavku za čitanje i pisanje hardverskih "
"registara periferije MCU-a, kao i bilo koje druge lokacije u adresnom "
"prostoru SoC-a."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:26
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 8-bit memory accessor. ``mem8[addr]`` reads an ``int`` in the "
"range 0-255 from the byte at ``addr``; ``mem8[addr] = value`` writes the low"
" 8 bits of ``value``. ``addr`` may be any byte-aligned address."
msgstr ""
"Indeksirani 8-bitni pristupnik memoriji. ``mem8[addr]`` čita ``int`` u "
"rasponu 0-255 iz bajta na ``addr``\\ ; ``mem8[addr] = value`` piše donjih 8 "
"bitova vrijednosti ``value``\\ . ``addr`` može biti bilo koja adresa "
"poravnata na bajt."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:32
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 16-bit (halfword) memory accessor. ``mem16[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` writes the low 16 "
"bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 2 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Indeksirani 16-bitni (poluriječni) pristupnik memoriji. ``mem16[addr]`` čita"
" ``int`` u rasponu 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` piše donjih 16 bitova. "
"``addr`` mora biti poravnat na 2 bajta."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:38
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 32-bit (word) memory accessor. ``mem32[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` writes the low 32"
" bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 4 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Indeksirani 32-bitni (riječni) pristupnik memoriji. ``mem32[addr]`` čita "
"``int`` u rasponu 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` piše donjih 32 bita."
" ``addr`` mora biti poravnat na 4 bajta."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:44
msgid "Peripheral register constants"
msgstr "Konstante registara periferije"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :mod:`stm` module exposes the full set of CMSIS register addresses and "
"offsets for whichever STM32 family the firmware was compiled for. The names "
"mirror ST's CMSIS headers exactly: ``STM32F427xx``, ``STM32F765xx``, "
"``STM32H743xx`` and ``STM32N657xx`` on the M4, M7, H7 family (H7 / H7 Plus /"
" Pure Thermal) and N6 OpenMV Cams respectively. The full set of names is "
"several hundred symbols per family (271 on M4, 306 on M7, 494 on H7, 594 on "
"N6); enumerating them here would simply duplicate ST's reference manual and "
"CMSIS headers."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`stm` izlaže potpuni skup CMSIS adresa registara i pomaka za onu "
"STM32 obitelj za koju je ugrađeni program (firmware) bio preveden. Imena "
"točno zrcale ST-ove CMSIS zaglavlja: ``STM32F427xx``\\ , ``STM32F765xx``\\ ,"
" ``STM32H743xx`` i ``STM32N657xx`` na M4, M7, H7 obitelji (H7 / H7 Plus / "
"Pure Thermal) odnosno N6 OpenMV Cam kamerama. Potpuni skup imena iznosi "
"nekoliko stotina simbola po obitelji (271 na M4, 306 na M7, 494 na H7, 594 "
"na N6); njihovo nabrajanje ovdje samo bi duplo ponovilo ST-ov referentni "
"priručnik i CMSIS zaglavlja."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:55
msgid "Two naming conventions are used:"
msgstr "Koriste se dvije konvencije imenovanja:"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:57
msgid ""
"Constants named after a peripheral instance (``GPIOA``, ``USART1``, "
"``TIM2``, ...) are **absolute base addresses**."
msgstr ""
"Konstante nazvane po instanci periferije (\\ ``GPIOA``\\ , ``USART1``\\ , "
"``TIM2``\\ , ...) su **apsolutne bazne adrese**\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:59
msgid ""
"Constants prefixed with a peripheral type (``GPIO_BSRR``, ``USART_CR1``, "
"``TIM_CCR1``, ...) are **register offsets** relative to the matching base."
msgstr ""
"Konstante s prefiksom tipa periferije (\\ ``GPIO_BSRR``\\ , ``USART_CR1``\\ "
", ``TIM_CCR1``\\ , ...) su **pomaci registara** u odnosu na odgovarajuću "
"bazu."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:62
msgid ""
"Add an absolute base and a register offset to get the full address of a "
"single register. For example ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` is the absolute "
"address of ``GPIOA->BSRR``."
msgstr ""
"Zbrojite apsolutnu bazu i pomak registra kako biste dobili punu adresu "
"pojedinačnog registra. Na primjer ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` je apsolutna"
" adresa ``GPIOA->BSRR``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:66
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:77
msgid "Representative constants"
msgstr "Reprezentativne konstante"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:79
msgid ""
"The selection below covers one entry per major peripheral category, picked "
"so the naming convention is clear at a glance. Every other CMSIS symbol for "
"the build target is also available on the module -- see :func:`__getattr__` "
"below for the type-checker fallback."
msgstr ""
"Donji odabir pokriva po jedan unos za svaku glavnu kategoriju periferije, "
"biran tako da konvencija imenovanja bude jasna na prvi pogled. Svaki drugi "
"CMSIS simbol za ciljnu kompilaciju također je dostupan u modulu -- "
"pogledajte :func:`__getattr__` u nastavku za rezervno ponašanje pri provjeri"
" tipova."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:87
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``GPIOA`` peripheral. ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (range "
"depends on the MCU package) follow the same pattern."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa periferije ``GPIOA``\\ . ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (raspon ovisi "
"o pakiranju MCU-a) slijede isti obrazac."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:93
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``USART1`` peripheral. Other USART / UART instances are "
"exposed under ``USART2``, ``USART3``, ``UART4`` ... as available."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa periferije ``USART1``\\ . Druge USART / UART instance izložene "
"su pod ``USART2``\\ , ``USART3``\\ , ``UART4`` ... ovisno o dostupnosti."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:99
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``SPI1`` peripheral. Additional SPI instances appear as "
"``SPI2``, ``SPI3``, ... up to the MCU's count."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa periferije ``SPI1``\\ . Dodatne SPI instance pojavljuju se kao "
"``SPI2``\\ , ``SPI3``\\ , ... do broja koji MCU podržava."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:105
msgid "Base address of the ``I2C1`` peripheral. ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` follow."
msgstr "Bazna adresa periferije ``I2C1``\\ . ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` slijede."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:110
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``TIM1`` advanced-control timer. General-purpose and "
"basic timers (``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` as available) follow the same naming."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa naprednog upravljačkog mjerača vremena ``TIM1``\\ . Mjerači "
"vremena opće namjene i osnovni mjerači vremena (\\ ``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` "
"ovisno o dostupnosti) slijede isto imenovanje."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:116
msgid ""
"Base address of ``ADC1``. ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` appear on MCUs with multiple "
"ADC blocks."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa ``ADC1``\\ . ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` pojavljuju se na MCU-ovima s "
"više ADC blokova."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:122
msgid "Base address of the DAC peripheral, on MCUs that have one."
msgstr "Bazna adresa DAC periferije, na MCU-ovima koji je imaju."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:127
msgid ""
"Base address of ``DMA1``. ``DMA2`` is present on most STM32s; H7-class parts"
" also expose ``BDMA``, ``MDMA`` and (on the N6) ``HPDMA`` / ``GPDMA``."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa ``DMA1``\\ . ``DMA2`` je prisutan na većini STM32-ova; dijelovi"
" klase H7 također izlažu ``BDMA``\\ , ``MDMA`` i (na N6) ``HPDMA`` / "
"``GPDMA``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:134
msgid "Base address of the Reset and Clock Control peripheral."
msgstr "Bazna adresa periferije Reset and Clock Control."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:139
msgid "Base address of the External Interrupt / Event Controller."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa upravljača vanjskih prekida / događaja (External Interrupt / "
"Event Controller)."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:144
msgid ""
"Base address of the embedded flash controller (the peripheral, not the flash"
" array itself)."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa upravljača ugrađene flash memorije (periferije, ne samog polja "
"flash memorije)."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:150
msgid "Base address of the System Configuration Controller."
msgstr ""
"Bazna adresa upravljača konfiguracije sustava (System Configuration "
"Controller)."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:155
msgid "Base address of the Power Control peripheral."
msgstr "Bazna adresa periferije Power Control."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:160
msgid "Offset of the GPIO bit set/reset register within any ``GPIOx`` base."
msgstr ""
"Pomak registra za postavljanje/poništavanje bita GPIO-a unutar bilo koje "
"baze ``GPIOx``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:165
msgid "Offset of the GPIO input data register."
msgstr "Pomak ulaznog podatkovnog registra GPIO-a."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:170
msgid "Offset of the GPIO output data register."
msgstr "Pomak izlaznog podatkovnog registra GPIO-a."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:175
msgid "Offset of the USART/UART control register 1."
msgstr "Pomak USART/UART upravljačkog registra 1."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:180
msgid "Offset of the timer control register 1."
msgstr "Pomak upravljačkog registra 1 mjerača vremena."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:185
msgid ""
"Offset of the timer capture/compare register 1. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... "
"``TIM_CCR4`` follow on timers that have multiple channels."
msgstr ""
"Pomak registra za hvatanje/usporedbu 1 mjerača vremena. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... "
"``TIM_CCR4`` slijede na mjeračima vremena koji imaju više kanala."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:191
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock control register."
msgstr "Pomak RCC registra upravljanja taktom."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:196
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock configuration register."
msgstr "Pomak RCC registra konfiguracije takta."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:200
msgid ""
"Dynamic-attribute fallback: any CMSIS symbol exposed by the firmware that "
"isn't individually listed above (e.g. ``stm.FDCAN1``, ``stm.OCTOSPI1``, "
"``stm.GPIO_AFR``, the various bit-field shifts and masks, ...) still "
"resolves to its absolute address or offset as an ``int``."
msgstr ""
"Rezervno ponašanje za dinamičke atribute: svaki CMSIS simbol koji izlaže "
"ugrađeni program (firmware), a koji nije pojedinačno naveden gore (npr. "
"``stm.FDCAN1``\\ , ``stm.OCTOSPI1``\\ , ``stm.GPIO_AFR``\\ , razni pomaci i "
"maske bitnih polja, ...) i dalje se razrješava u svoju apsolutnu adresu ili "
"pomak kao ``int``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:205
msgid ""
"The runtime module populates these symbols directly into its globals dict at"
" import time, so ``__getattr__`` is never actually invoked. The signature is"
" exposed solely so static type checkers (Pyright, Pylance, mypy) accept "
"``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` without a \"module has no attribute\" diagnostic."
msgstr ""
"Modul tijekom izvođenja popunjava te simbole izravno u svoj globalni rječnik"
" (globals) prilikom uvoza, pa se ``__getattr__`` zapravo nikada ne poziva. "
"Potpis je izložen isključivo kako bi statički provjerivači tipova (Pyright, "
"Pylance, mypy) prihvatili ``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` bez dijagnostike \"module"
" has no attribute\"."
